{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜呜呜、美羽学姐啊啊啊——……」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1715", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪，你稍微冷静一下。\\n　你是打算让天羽学姐湿漉漉地离开吗？」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": "「纱凪，你稍微冷静一下。　你是打算让天羽学姐湿漉漉地离开吗？」", "plain_idx": 192, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4507", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但……但是呜呜呜呜……」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1716", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐的毕业典礼结束了，\\n我们全员一起为学姐送行。", "text_idx": 197, "plain": "美羽学姐的毕业典礼结束了，我们全员一起为学姐送行。", "plain_idx": 198, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "话说这么说，但这之后大家打算一起喝酒……\\n其实喝不了，所以我们准备去学姐的家里狠狠热闹一番。", "text_idx": 199, "plain": "话说这么说，但这之后大家打算一起喝酒……其实喝不了，所以我们准备去学姐的家里狠狠热闹一番。", "plain_idx": 200, "len": 47, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然，聚会之后就是我们两人独处了……", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜呜、呜哇……我今天要一整天都和学姐在一起呃呃呃——」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": "「呜呜、呜哇……我今天要一整天都和学姐在一起呃呃呃——」", "plain_idx": 202, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1717", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "完了，看来独处没戏了。", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵，虽然是毕业了，\\n　但我还是会时不时来活动室玩的，不用那么舍不得啦～」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": "「呵呵，虽然是毕业了，　但我还是会时不时来活动室玩的，不用那么舍不得啦～」", "plain_idx": 207, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2473", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我就是舍不得，\\n　这个没有美羽学姐的灰色的校园生活……呜哇哇啊？！」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": "「我就是舍不得，　这个没有美羽学姐的灰色的校园生活……呜哇哇啊？！」", "plain_idx": 210, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1718", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪抱着头蹲了下来。", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来她这个后遗症要持续一段时间了。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哥，今天不用打工吗？」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1347", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，今天请假了，没事的」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "正式的学校合并已经定下来了，\\n从这个春天起我们就是“结姬学院”的学生了。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": "正式的学校合并已经定下来了，从这个春天起我们就是“结姬学院”的学生了。", "plain_idx": 219, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然今年开始多少会有点部费了，\\n但作为社团长果然还是想为了动物们努力工作一下。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": "虽然今年开始多少会有点部费了，但作为社团长果然还是想为了动物们努力工作一下。", "plain_idx": 221, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐之前还说想帮我们出一些部费，\\n当然被我和纱凪给拒绝了。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": "学姐之前还说想帮我们出一些部费，当然被我和纱凪给拒绝了。", "plain_idx": 223, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们也不能一直被美羽学姐照顾。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这也是为了我们这个社团能继续活动下去。", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？你开始打工了吗？」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4508", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「最近刚开始」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从前些日子开始，我每周都会去车站前的管家咖啡厅工作三天。", "text_idx": 229, "plain": "从前些日子开始，我每周都会去车站前的管家咖啡厅工作三天。", "plain_idx": 229, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自己也过上这样的生活后，我就更加明白美羽学姐有多厉害了。", "text_idx": 230, "plain": "自己也过上这样的生活后，我就更加明白美羽学姐有多厉害了。", "plain_idx": 230, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这不是简简单单就能坚持下来的事情。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以学姐才没说想让我当这个社团长的吧。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": "所以学姐才没说想让我当这个社团长的吧。", "plain_idx": 232, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和学姐说了我去打工的事情后，\\n她非常开心，但也十分疑惑。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": "和学姐说了我去打工的事情后，她非常开心，但也十分疑惑。", "plain_idx": 234, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『没事的，这是我自己决定的』", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我这么说了之后，学姐突然哭了出来。", "text_idx": 236, "plain": "我这么说了之后，学姐突然哭了出来。", "plain_idx": 236, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那是和熊喵那时不同的、喜悦的眼泪。", "text_idx": 237, "plain": "那是和熊喵那时不同的、喜悦的眼泪。", "plain_idx": 237, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2474", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，她现在也依然带着她一如往常的笑容在我身边。", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们约好了明年我毕业后就同居。", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过在那之前我们也差不多像是同居一样了，\\n所以我想我们在一起的时间不会变少。", "text_idx": 242, "plain": "不过在那之前我们也差不多像是同居一样了，所以我想我们在一起的时间不会变少。", "plain_idx": 243, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "能像今天这样，真的多亏了大家。", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学、安洁、樱乃、隼太、还有纱凪……", "text_idx": 245, "plain": "濑名同学、安洁、樱乃、隼太、还有纱凪……", "plain_idx": 245, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没有大家的话，我和学姐也做不到能像现在这样。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": "没有大家的话，我和学姐也做不到能像现在这样。", "plain_idx": 246, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐肯定也是这么想的。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——这些不只是一个人的功劳，都是因为有了大家的帮忙。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": "——这些不只是一个人的功劳，都是因为有了大家的帮忙。", "plain_idx": 248, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就连熊喵当时也是，默默注视着、守护着我们。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": "就连熊喵当时也是，默默注视着、守护着我们。", "plain_idx": 249, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了。我们差不多该出发了」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1720", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也是」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4510", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1349", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道了」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3470", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？不是要去学姐家吗，大家一起……」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我刚出声，大家就一起摇了摇头。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来是大家在照顾我们。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我最近才注意到。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一开始让我那般痛苦的校园氛围，\\n不知何时也已经能够让我安心下来了。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": "一开始让我那般痛苦的校园氛围，不知何时也已经能够让我安心下来了。", "plain_idx": 265, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "森林的味道，以及与之交融的温暖人情。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "它们看似在这世上随处可见，但其实并非如此。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这个地方，这座校园里，有着我想守护的重要之物。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……喂，新吾」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1722", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还有，我新结交的“好朋友”——", "text_idx": 271, "plain": "还有，我新结交的“好朋友”——", "plain_idx": 271, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1723", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们自然地对上视线。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "先忍不住笑出来的是她。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们先去忙了，还能让你调情的也就剩今天了」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": "「我们先去忙了，还能让你调情的也就剩今天了」", "plain_idx": 275, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1724", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说完，她爽快地转过身去。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕竟从明天开始，你就得作为环境保全社的社团长好好努力了」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": "「毕竟从明天开始，你就得作为环境保全社的社团长好好努力了」", "plain_idx": 278, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1725", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪……」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪走在大伙前面，率先迈步离去。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她可能还没有发现吧。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……到最后，我还是没能成为像美羽学姐一样的人』", "text_idx": 283, "plain": "『……到最后，我还是没能成为像美羽学姐一样的人』", "plain_idx": 283, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "曾说出这些丧气话的她——", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在那挺直的背影，和美羽学姐一样，坚强，而又温柔。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": "现在那挺直的背影，和美羽学姐一样，坚强，而又温柔。", "plain_idx": 285, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我往旁边看去，学姐正一脸放心地看着她。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "于是我也目送着她离开，直到大家的身影从视野里消失。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": "于是我也目送着她离开，直到大家的身影从视野里消失。", "plain_idx": 287, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2477", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "确认周围没有人后，学姐牵起了我的手。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "能和她一起穿着校服度过的日子，今天也是最后一天了。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我真的很想继续和学姐一起度过校园生活。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想和她在这个地方创造更多属于我们两人的回忆。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果能更早一点遇到学姐……」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2478", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果能更早一点遇到，然后呢？」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2479", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐坏笑着反问我。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她肯定是明白的吧。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们心中的“答案”是一致的。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不，即使更早一点遇到也是一样的」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，是一样的♪」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2480", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们会迎来这样的一天是无法避免的。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但在这之后，我和学姐仍会继续创造更多的回忆。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只不过，还有一件事。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果真的有神明存在。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2481", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我希望，现在也仍遥望着森林的她，\\n能在此刻留下一份她与熊喵的回忆。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": "我希望，现在也仍遥望着森林的她，能在此刻留下一份她与熊喵的回忆。", "plain_idx": 309, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我希望，她能再抱熊喵一次。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……再见了，小熊喵」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2482", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？！」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "小声说完之后，美羽学姐深吸了一口气。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小熊喵，要保重哦————！」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2483", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "洪亮的呼喊声像在山间一样来回回荡。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也跟着喊了出来。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比起向神明祈祷，这样要更直接得多。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「熊喵，要保重啊————！！！」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为我觉得，这份感情一定能通过话语传达到熊喵那里。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「走吧，新吾」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2484", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐充满活力地迈开了步伐。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她用力地晃起了我们牵在一起的手。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对了对了，我想拜托你一件事」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2485", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么事？」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，那个嘛」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2486", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们不会再停滞不前了。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们会牵着彼此的手一直前进，然后，偶尔回头看看。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在这之后……我想和你一起，被很多猫猫围着生活下去」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": "「在这之后……我想和你一起，被很多猫猫围着生活下去」", "plain_idx": 334, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2487", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和最重要的你一起」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2488", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和我们最爱的这些孩子，永远、永远在一起——」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": "「和我们最爱的这些孩子，永远、永远在一起——」", "plain_idx": 338, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu2489", "char_id": "みう"}]}
